                                "sense_id": "235e3b26-8538-3ad6-b348-de4e29c2817e",
                                "text": "To show that there is nothing absurd in this notable scheme of sending first-rate men-of-war skirling along the surface of the ocean, Mr. Macneill tells the following most marvellous story : […]"
